'''Yesterday's Enemy''' (昨日の敵は今日の友, ''Kinō no Teki wa Kyō no Tomo'', '''Yesterday's Enemy Is Today's Friend''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Cannon Start Level UP (M): Cannon gauge will be filled +4 steps/40% charged.

